{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07904","headline":"齿坐呈山南诸隐 · 孟浩然","name":"齿坐呈山南诸隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"习公有遗坐，高在白云陲。\n樵子不见识，山僧赏自知。\n以余爲好事，携手一来窥。\n竹露闲夜滴，松风清昼吹。\n从来抱微尚，况复感前规。\n於此无奇策，苍生奚以爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}